  "description": "Derived by hand from flora 6.10.1, 6.10.3 and 6.4.2 (test 23 of 16). InsertOccupant of a building (data3 = 0x278128A0) with box (100..120, 0..30, 200..220) demolishes every flora occupant the box query (98, -2, 198)..(122, 2 + 1.7e38, 222) returns: listed in its 64 m cells and overlapping it strictly (FQ6; boxes that only touch are not returned). Flora boxes are their position +- 1 in x and z. x 97 (box to 98, touching) kept, x 98 and x 122 removed, x 123 (box from 122) kept; z 197 kept, z 198 removed; a tree at y 5000 removed (any height), one wholly below y = -2 kept. A street (network flag 0x8) uses margin 0 and y from 0 upwards: x 299 kept, x 300 removed, a tree whose box ends at y 0 kept. A power line (flag 0x20 only), a preview building (property 0x029244DB), a prop, and a building announced with data3 of another type remove nothing. Removal is RemoveOccupant for each listed flora (DemolishFloraOccupant with flags 0).",
